# Reuse a sound
@scenario office_lesson_11
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk listen]
pip: Two scenes use the same chime. Write it once and return to whoever called it.
[call chime]
pip: Find the chime subroutine. Change its sound once and play the cue again.
@label check
pip: Which command comes at the end of a local subroutine?
> return -> correct
> end -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Return resumes the caller. End finishes the scenario. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Return resumes the caller. End finishes the scenario.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_11]
[flag tutorial_done_11]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_3]
@label chime
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
[return]
